  "job_B15.4.10_20251003_114325": {
    "text": "Ic Eadwine munuk cilda m\u00e6stere an Niwan mynstre grete \u00fee wel \u00c6lfsige biscop.\nIc ky\u00fee \u00fee laford \u00fe\u00e6t nu for \u00fereon gearan ic l\u00e6ig innan minan portice anbuton nontid & me atewde \u00fe\u00e6r\nIc \u00fe\u00e6s swi\u00fee bli\u00fee w\u00e6s.\nIc eode to minan abbode \u00c6lfwine & bed hin\u00e6 \u00fe\u00e6t ic moste nor\u00fe faran to \u00fean halgan & hine gesecan.\nAc min abbod \u00c6lfwine me \u00fe\u00e6s forwirnde & eac forbead.\nIc \u00fea f\u00e6ng on minne ag\u00e6nne r\u00e6d & eode me \u00feid\u00e6r nor\u00f0.\n& me \u00fe\u00e6r \u00c6gelwine bisceop mid weorscipe underfeng.\nMe geu\u00fee God & \u00fee halga \u00fe\u00e6t ic hine minan handan gewochs & his heafod mid kambe gekemde & his\nSum ic \u00fe\u00e6r let & sum ic her habbe.\nNu hlaford b\u00e6\u00feohte ic me \u00fe\u00e6t ic nefde mines abbodes leafe.\n& ic \u00fe\u00e6r fore ham g\u00e6wende & kom me into Ealdan Mynstre & gesohte Crist & Sancte Peter & Sancte\nAc ic funde Leofwine \u00feone decanum & ealle \u00fea gebro\u00f0ra.\n& hi me weor\u00felice & bli\u00feelice underfengan & me to minan abbode ge\u00feingodan.\n& he me bli\u00feelice underfeng si Gode lof.\nNu wille ic \u00fe\u00e6 ky\u00fean hlaford \u00c6lfsige biscop hu \u00feeos cwydr\u00e6dene fyrm\u00e6st w\u00e6s gesta\u00feelod betwyx\nHure hlaford Sancte Alwold l\u00e6ig seok & him kom to \u00fee haliga Dunstan of Cantwarabyrig for hine to\n& ure ealder \u00c6\u00fe\u00e6lgar abbod \u00feyder eode & munekas mid him, \u00fe\u00e6t was Boia \u00fee ealda & \u00c6lfric decanus\n& \u00fe\u00e6r coman munekas of Ealdan Minstre \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s Ealdwig & Wlstan cantor & Godwine decanus &\n\u00dea aras Boia \u00fe\u00e6 ealda munuk & s\u00e6t a cneowan \u00e6tforan Sancte A\u00feelwolde.\n& bed hine \u00fe\u00e6t he scolde settan gode lagan betwyx \u00fean twam mynstran on muneca dagan ealswa\n& \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s gif \u00e6nig preost forferde on a\u00feere steda hi scolde ealle tog\u00e6dere kuman & \u00fe\u00e6t lic bebirian &\n& gif \u00e6nigan preoste mistimode on a\u00feran mynstre ne fore he nahwider ac gesohte he his neahgeburas &\n\u00dea \u00feis gehyrde Sancte A\u00feelwold \u00fea h\u00e6 rede \u00fe\u00e6t hit swa w\u00e6re nu on his timan & on \u00feara muneka &",
